{
  "name": "Weekly Editorial Memo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Mémo éditorial hebdomadaire\n\n**Catalogue réel — données publiques**\n\n1. Trigger (manuel ou lundi 07:00)\n2. POST `gia-api` → /api/memo/editorial\n3. Un run est enregistré **dans les deux cas**\n\nL'API refuse d'émettre un mémo qui échoue à ses post-conditions : elle renvoie 500 et enregistre l'échec. Le `continueOnFail` du noeud HTTP existe pour que ce 500 arrive jusqu'à la branche d'échec au lieu de tuer le workflow.\n\nHistorique : dashboard → Automatisation",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-260, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [1],
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Every Monday 07:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [160, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://gia-api:8000/api/memo/editorial",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "save", "value": "true" },
            { "name": "candidate_limit", "value": "5" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-editorial-memo",
      "name": "Compose Editorial Memo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [480, 300],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "status-ok",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 200,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-emitted",
      "name": "Memo emitted?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [740, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "title",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "generated_on",
              "name": "generated_on",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.generated_on }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "saved_path",
              "name": "saved_path",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.saved_path }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "markdown",
              "name": "markdown",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.markdown }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "provenance",
              "name": "provenance",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.provenance }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-memo",
      "name": "Format Memo Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1000, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "status",
              "name": "status_code",
              "value": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "reason",
              "name": "reason",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.detail.message || $json.body.detail }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "undeclared",
              "name": "undeclared_figures",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body.detail.undeclared_figures || []) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "leaks",
              "name": "funnel_vocabulary_leaks",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body.detail.funnel_vocabulary_leaks || []) }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-failure",
      "name": "Explain Rejection",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1000, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Branche d'échec\n\n409 = catalogue insuffisant.\n500 = post-conditions non satisfaites (chiffre non déclaré, ou vocabulaire d'entonnoir hors de la section « limites »).\n\nDans les deux cas le run est **déjà enregistré** côté API : cette branche sert à le voir ici, pas à le journaliser.\n\nÀ brancher sur Slack/e-mail selon la destination réelle.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-failure",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1300, 400]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Compose Editorial Memo", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Every Monday 07:00": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Compose Editorial Memo", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Compose Editorial Memo": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Memo emitted?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Memo emitted?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Format Memo Fields", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Explain Rejection", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "tags": []
}
